#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`ssd1306` --- OLED Driver"
msgstr ":mod:`ssd1306` --- OLED 驱动"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module provides a driver for SSD1306-based OLED displays. Two transport"
" variants are supported: I2C (:class:`SSD1306_I2C`) and SPI "
"(:class:`SSD1306_SPI`). Both inherit the drawing API from :class:`SSD1306`, "
"which wraps a :class:`framebuf.FrameBuffer1`."
msgstr ""
"本模块提供基于 SSD1306 的 OLED 显示屏驱动。支持两种传输方式：I2C（\\ :class:`SSD1306_I2C`\\ ）和 "
"SPI（\\ :class:`SSD1306_SPI`\\ ）。两者都从 :class:`SSD1306` 继承绘图 API，后者封装了一个 "
":class:`framebuf.FrameBuffer1`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:12
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "示例::"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:24
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "类"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:28
msgid ""
"Base class for SSD1306 OLED displays. Subclasses must initialize "
"``self.framebuf`` and provide ``write_cmd``, ``write_data``, "
"``write_framebuf`` and ``poweron`` methods."
msgstr ""
"SSD1306 OLED 显示屏的基类。子类必须初始化 ``self.framebuf`` 并提供 ``write_cmd``\\ 、\\ "
"``write_data``\\ 、\\ ``write_framebuf`` 和 ``poweron`` 方法。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:32 ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:109
#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:131
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr "参数："

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:34 ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:41
#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:111 ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:133
msgid "``width`` -- Display width in pixels."
msgstr "``width`` —— 显示宽度（以像素为单位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:35
msgid "``height`` -- Display height in pixels (must be a multiple of 8)."
msgstr "``height`` —— 显示高度（以像素为单位，必须是 8 的倍数）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:36
msgid ""
"``external_vcc`` -- ``True`` if an external VCC source is used, ``False`` to"
" enable the internal charge pump."
msgstr "``external_vcc`` —— 若使用外部 VCC 电源则为 ``True``\\ ，若启用内部电荷泵则为 ``False``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:39
msgid "Instance attributes:"
msgstr "实例属性："

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:42 ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:112
#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:134
msgid "``height`` -- Display height in pixels."
msgstr "``height`` —— 显示高度（以像素为单位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:43
msgid "``external_vcc`` -- External VCC flag."
msgstr "``external_vcc`` —— 外部 VCC 标志。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:44
msgid "``pages`` -- Number of 8-pixel-tall pages (``height // 8``)."
msgstr "``pages`` —— 8 像素高的页数（\\ ``height // 8``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:48
msgid ""
"Send the initialization command sequence to the display, clear the "
"framebuffer, and refresh. Called automatically by ``__init__``."
msgstr "向显示屏发送初始化命令序列、清空帧缓冲区并刷新。由 ``__init__`` 自动调用。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:54
msgid "Turn the display off (sleep mode)."
msgstr "关闭显示屏（睡眠模式）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:58
msgid "Set the display contrast."
msgstr "设置显示对比度。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:60
msgid "``contrast`` -- Contrast value in the range ``0``--``255``."
msgstr "``contrast`` —— 对比度值，范围为 ``0``--``255``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:64
msgid "Invert the display colors."
msgstr "反转显示颜色。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:66
msgid ""
"``invert`` -- ``0`` for normal output, ``1`` for inverted output. Only the "
"least significant bit is used."
msgstr "``invert`` —— ``0`` 表示正常输出，\\ ``1`` 表示反转输出。仅使用最低有效位。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:71
msgid "Flush the internal framebuffer to the display."
msgstr "将内部帧缓冲区刷新到显示屏。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:75
msgid "Fill the entire framebuffer with a single color."
msgstr "用单一颜色填充整个帧缓冲区。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:77
msgid "``col`` -- Color value (``0`` for off, ``1`` for on)."
msgstr "``col`` —— 颜色值（\\ ``0`` 表示熄灭，\\ ``1`` 表示点亮）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:81
msgid "Set the color of a single pixel."
msgstr "设置单个像素的颜色。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:83
msgid "``x`` -- Column coordinate."
msgstr "``x`` —— 列坐标。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:84
msgid "``y`` -- Row coordinate."
msgstr "``y`` —— 行坐标。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:85
msgid "``col`` -- Color value (``0`` or ``1``)."
msgstr "``col`` —— 颜色值（\\ ``0`` 或 ``1``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:89
msgid ""
"Shift the framebuffer contents by the given offsets. Pixels shifted out of "
"bounds are lost; vacated pixels are left untouched."
msgstr "按给定偏移量平移帧缓冲区内容。移出边界的像素将丢失；空出的像素保持不变。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:93
msgid "``dx`` -- Horizontal shift in pixels."
msgstr "``dx`` —— 水平平移量（以像素为单位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:94
msgid "``dy`` -- Vertical shift in pixels."
msgstr "``dy`` —— 垂直平移量（以像素为单位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:98
msgid "Draw a string using the built-in 8x8 font."
msgstr "使用内置的 8x8 字体绘制字符串。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:100
msgid "``string`` -- Text to draw."
msgstr "``string`` —— 要绘制的文本。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:101
msgid "``x`` -- Starting column coordinate."
msgstr "``x`` —— 起始列坐标。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:102
msgid "``y`` -- Starting row coordinate."
msgstr "``y`` —— 起始行坐标。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:103
msgid "``col`` -- Foreground color (default ``1``)."
msgstr "``col`` —— 前景颜色（默认为 ``1``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:107
msgid "I2C-connected SSD1306 driver. Inherits from :class:`SSD1306`."
msgstr "I2C 连接的 SSD1306 驱动。继承自 :class:`SSD1306`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:113
msgid "``i2c`` -- An initialized ``machine.I2C`` (or compatible) object."
msgstr "``i2c`` —— 一个已初始化的 ``machine.I2C``\\ （或兼容）对象。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:114
msgid "``addr`` -- 7-bit I2C device address (default ``0x3C``)."
msgstr "``addr`` —— 7 位 I2C 设备地址（默认为 ``0x3C``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:115 ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:139
msgid ""
"``external_vcc`` -- ``True`` for external VCC, ``False`` to use the internal"
" charge pump."
msgstr "``external_vcc`` —— 使用外部 VCC 时为 ``True``\\ ，使用内部电荷泵时为 ``False``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:120
msgid "Send a single command byte to the display over I2C."
msgstr "通过 I2C 向显示屏发送单个命令字节。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:124
msgid "Send a buffer of pixel data to the display over I2C."
msgstr "通过 I2C 向显示屏发送一缓冲区的像素数据。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:128
msgid ""
"SPI-connected SSD1306 driver. Inherits from :class:`SSD1306`. Uses a fixed "
"SPI clock rate of 10 MHz."
msgstr "SPI 连接的 SSD1306 驱动。继承自 :class:`SSD1306`\\ 。使用固定的 10 MHz SPI 时钟速率。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:135
msgid "``spi`` -- A ``pyb.SPI`` (or compatible) object."
msgstr "``spi`` —— 一个 ``pyb.SPI``\\ （或兼容）对象。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:136
msgid "``dc`` -- Data/command select pin."
msgstr "``dc`` —— 数据/命令选择引脚。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:137
msgid "``res`` -- Reset pin."
msgstr "``res`` —— 复位引脚。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:138
msgid "``cs`` -- Chip-select pin."
msgstr "``cs`` —— 片选引脚。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:144
msgid "Send a single command byte to the display over SPI."
msgstr "通过 SPI 向显示屏发送单个命令字节。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:148
msgid "Transmit the entire framebuffer to the display over SPI."
msgstr "通过 SPI 将整个帧缓冲区传输到显示屏。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:152
msgid "Toggle the reset line to power the display on."
msgstr "切换复位线以给显示屏上电。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:155
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常量"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:160
msgid "Command ``0x81`` -- set display contrast."
msgstr "命令 ``0x81`` —— 设置显示对比度。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:165
msgid "Command ``0xA4`` -- resume display from RAM contents."
msgstr "命令 ``0xA4`` —— 从 RAM 内容恢复显示。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:170
msgid "Command ``0xA6`` -- normal/inverse display select."
msgstr "命令 ``0xA6`` —— 正常/反相显示选择。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:175
msgid "Command ``0xAE`` -- display on/off."
msgstr "命令 ``0xAE`` —— 显示开/关。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:180
msgid "Command ``0x20`` -- memory addressing mode."
msgstr "命令 ``0x20`` —— 内存寻址模式。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:185
msgid "Command ``0x21`` -- column address range."
msgstr "命令 ``0x21`` —— 列地址范围。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:190
msgid "Command ``0x22`` -- page address range."
msgstr "命令 ``0x22`` —— 页地址范围。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:195
msgid "Command ``0x40`` -- display start line."
msgstr "命令 ``0x40`` —— 显示起始行。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:200
msgid "Command ``0xA0`` -- segment remap."
msgstr "命令 ``0xA0`` —— 段重映射。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:205
msgid "Command ``0xA8`` -- multiplex ratio."
msgstr "命令 ``0xA8`` —— 复用比率。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:210
msgid "Command ``0xC0`` -- COM output scan direction."
msgstr "命令 ``0xC0`` —— COM 输出扫描方向。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:215
msgid "Command ``0xD3`` -- display offset."
msgstr "命令 ``0xD3`` —— 显示偏移。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:220
msgid "Command ``0xDA`` -- COM pins hardware configuration."
msgstr "命令 ``0xDA`` —— COM 引脚硬件配置。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:225
msgid "Command ``0xD5`` -- display clock divide ratio / oscillator frequency."
msgstr "命令 ``0xD5`` —— 显示时钟分频比 / 振荡器频率。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:231
msgid "Command ``0xD9`` -- pre-charge period."
msgstr "命令 ``0xD9`` —— 预充电周期。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:236
msgid "Command ``0xDB`` -- VCOMH deselect level."
msgstr "命令 ``0xDB`` —— VCOMH 取消选择电平。"

#: ../../library/omv.ssd1306.rst:241
msgid "Command ``0x8D`` -- charge pump configuration."
msgstr "命令 ``0x8D`` —— 电荷泵配置。"
